From 7bf9ea375d706b8a8acc2b1899c1b7ec14670383 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yooz <136268860+y-o-o-z@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 22:12:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] local: Polish interface, erssi@tahio branding
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Every visible text in Polish: chat, event lines, condensed events with
Polish plural forms (1 osoba / 2 osoby / 5 osób), settings, network
manager, help (commands and shortcuts), context menus, notifications,
connection states, loading screen, server feedback (connection test,
WeeChat relay, rate limits), user list groups, dates (dayjs pl).

Branding: the app is erssi@tahio everywhere; NexusIRC appears only as a
credit line in Help. Help points to y-o-o-z/erssi instead of upstream
NexusIRC links; the upstream version checker is gone from Help. /quit is
described as closing all of erssi (it does, from the web).

Settings tabs get a separate label prop; the irssi and WeeChat tabs now
use their real route names, so they are marked active (they never were).

vue-tsc: 58 errors before and after (all pre-existing), eslint clean.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
